      <MissionDesc>IS TO ACQUIRE, MANAGE, MONITOR AND MAINTAIN LAND IN CALIFORNIA FOR HABITAT PROTECTION AND RESTORATION, AGRICULTURAL PRESERVATION, AND OTHER CONSERVATION PURPOSES. EHC CURRENTLY MANAGES APPROXIMATELY 8,000 ACRES OF CONSERVED OPEN SPACE LANDS.</MissionDesc>
