        <ExplanationTxt>EASEMENT #1 - REQUIRES THE PRESERVATION OF CRITICAL HABITAT FOR SEVERAL SPECIES. THE EASEMENT CONFINES THE USE OF THE PROPERTY TO ACTIVITIES THAT ARE CONSISTENT WITH SUCH PURPOSES. THE ORGANIZATION DID NOT ASSIGN A VALUE ON THIS ACCEPTED EASEMENT.</ExplanationTxt>
